{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>$16/2件!外皮香脆+口感軟糯</p><p>IKEA美食站由7月24日起推出韓國大熱牛油年糕！外皮烤到香脆、內裡煙韌度十足，仲有如麻糬般的軟糯口感，散發濃郁牛油香氣。牛油年糕$16/2件、$26/4件，性價比高，每日數量有限，售完即止，大家記得去試吓啦！</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><p>IKEA 官方IG：@ikeahongkong</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178487282929194270_12766748996a62ff7d9ffaa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178487283097776935_11779793426a62ff7f75edc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178487283312627074_9750267456a62ff81af739.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178487283555081318_19685607866a62ff84a1fc0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178487283909153571_14533503516a62ff878f28f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178487284074790708_15866310356a62ff895cce1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T06:19:31.381226+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}